  Description: You served in the guard, out of either patriotism or the need for
    coin. Either way, you know how to get a difficult suspect to talk. However you
    left the guard, you might think of adventuring as a way to use your skills on
    a wider stage. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength or Charisma
    , and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Intimidation skill
    and the Legal Lore or Warfare Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Quick
    Coercion] skill feat.
